Wei Pengchen, a researcher with 37 years of dedicated work in linguistic studies, recently unveiled his original theoretical framework for the first time. As the founder of the Eastern Philosophical Cognitive-Generative Language Theory, Wei has consistently grounded his work in the fundamental logic of cosmic natural laws. By transcending the limitations of traditional language theories, he has constructed a system that integrates academic depth with practical applicability, thereby injecting new momentum into linguistic research and multilingual applications.

深耕语言研究领域 37 载的研究者韦朋辰，近日首次公开讲解原创理论体系 —— 韦朋辰生成派之 “七玄生成论”（又称《韦朋辰语言生成心经》）。作为东方哲学认知生成语言理论创始人，韦朋辰始终以宇宙自然规律为底层逻辑，打破传统语言理论局限，构建起兼具学术深度与实践价值的理论体系，为语言学研究与多语种应用注入全新动能。

