理论定位：逻辑自洽的科学猜想

Although proposed as a scientific conjecture yet to be fully empirically validated, the model possesses two core strengths:

该模型虽以科学猜想形式提出，尚未完全实证，但具备两大核心优势：

Logical Coherence: Forms a closed loop integrating cosmology, philosophical foundations, and language generation logic.
逻辑自洽：宇宙观、哲学内核与语言生成逻辑形成完整闭环
Practical Testability: Demonstrates breakthrough explanatory power beyond traditional grammatical theories in over 30 years of application, offering a novel cognitive pathway for linguistics rooted in Eastern cosmology.
实践可验：30 余年应用实践中，展现出对传统语法理论的突破性解释力，为语言学研究提供了源于东方宇宙观的全新认知路径
