Moving forward, Wei Pengchen will continue sharing theoretical interpretations, application guidelines, and practical cases to facilitate the transformation of academic achievements into practical value. Further explorations will deepen the theory’s applications in language processing, paving innovative pathways for integrating Eastern wisdom with language practice.

未来，韦朋辰将持续在平台分享理论解读、应用指南、实操案例等原创内容，推动学术成果转化为实用价值，深化理论在语言处理领域的探索，与广大读者共探东方智慧与语言应用的创新路径。

